{"synopsis":"“Apa gunanya menjadi Sword God di kehidupan masa laluku?”&#x20;\nEntah kenapa, saat kecil aku jadi teringat kehidupan masa laluku. Apa mungkin itu alasan kenapa aku sangat menikmati game VR yang kumainkan? Namun, kelainan bawaan yang kuidap akhirnya mencegahku mengakses VR, dan butuh tujuh tahun sampai solusinya muncul.&#x20;\n“Capsule itu harganya seratus juta won.”&#x20;\nMahal sekali.&#x20;\n“Oh iya, pernah dengar soal LEOS?”&#x20;\nLeague of Streaming? Turnamen streamer? Kenapa kau membahas itu?&#x20;\n“Hadiah utamanya Capsule ini. Bagaimana menurutmu? Mau coba?”","alternative_title":"검술 고인물의 게임방송","author":"Menyusul","artist":"Menyusul","chapters":[{"number":"28","chapter":"28","slug":"5e827018-241f-4b36-9d56-697380d2cce7","title":"Chapter 28","date":"2026-07-28"},{"number":"27","chapter":"27","slug":"33231a30-e586-4292-8d3d-3836828d8243","title":"Chapter 27","date":"2026-07-21"},{"number":"26","chapter":"26","slug":"3f5e82f4-9ad6-4906-85b6-aa9e2b3cfabf","title":"Chapter 26","date":"2026-07-15"},{"number":"25","chapter":"25","slug":"734fb64d-a9e7-4b56-9170-0a720a82fa07","title":"Chapter 25","date":"2026-07-07"},{"number":"24","chapter":"24","slug":"7ea11e51-a6ac-4ec7-a16a-740b4cfe091b","title":"Chapter 24","date":"2026-07-01"},{"number":"23","chapter":"23","slug":"87f1ac57-4643-49a4-83b8-1d37adff459f","title":"Chapter 23","date":"2026-06-23"},{"number":"22","chapter":"22","slug":"4133842f-c533-4033-aaef-72c47841bd81","title":"Chapter 22","date":"2026-06-15"},{"number":"21","chapter":"21","slug":"dff6b3aa-d823-436e-8c30-10c603221b72","title":"Chapter 21","date":"2026-06-09"},{"number":"20","chapter":"20","slug":"4a775c68-cbd9-49a3-8303-007057551984","title":"Chapter 20","date":"2026-06-04"},{"number":"19","chapter":"19","slug":"33b11ae3-b7c2-4513-a79c-4efddf7b4dfa","title":"Chapter 19","date":"2026-06-04"},{"number":"18","chapter":"18","slug":"c8496013-63f3-4293-aecc-bdf90c714221","title":"Chapter 18","date":"2026-06-04"},{"number":"17","chapter":"1